<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Happy Birthday Mimi 🎂</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background-color: #ffd6e8;
      font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      color: #e91e63;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      animation: fadeIn 2s ease-in-out;
    }

    .note {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      padding: 30px;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px;
      color: #444;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      animation: fadeUp 2s ease-in-out;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from {opacity: 0;}
      to {opacity: 1;}
    }

    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from {transform: translateY(20px); opacity: 0;}
      to {transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1;}
    }

    /* Floating hearts animation */
    .heart {
      position: absolute;
      color: #ff4081;
      font-size: 20px;
      animation: floatHearts 6s linear infinite;
      top: 100%;
    }

    @keyframes floatHearts {
      0% { transform: translateY(0) scale(1); opacity: 1; }
      100% { transform: translateY(-110vh) scale(1.8); opacity: 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Happy Birthday Mimi 🎂</h1>

  <div class="note">
    <p>Dear Mimi,</p>
    <p>
      I just wanted to take a moment to celebrate you today — not just because it’s your special day, 
      but because you’re someone truly special. You have this rare energy that lights up any space you walk into, 
      and I’ve always admired that about you.
    </p>
    <p>
      We’ve shared moments, laughs, and memories I’ll never forget, and I’m honestly grateful for every bit of it. 
      You deserve nothing but peace, happiness, and all the beautiful things life has to offer.
    </p>
    <p>
      Keep shining, keep smiling, and keep being the amazing person you are. 💖
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-weight: bold;">Warm wishes,<br>[Your Name]</p>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Generate floating hearts
    function createHeart() {
      const heart = document.createElement("div");
      heart.classList.add("heart");
      heart.innerText = "💖";
      heart.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + "vw";
      heart.style.animationDuration = 5 + Math.random() * 3 + "s";
      document.body.appendChild(heart);
      setTimeout(() => heart.remove(), 8000);
    }
    setInterval(createHeart, 400);
  </script>
</body>
</html>
